request.problem:
(本小题满分10分)选修4-5:不等式选讲，设函数$f\left( x \right)=\left| x-2 \right|+2x-3$,记$f\left( x \right)\le -1$的解集为M.
(Ⅰ)求集合M;
(Ⅱ)当$x\in M$时,证明:$x{{\left[ f\left( x \right) \right]}^{2}}-{{x}^{2}}f\left( x \right)\le 0$.

